 * nothing else; keep each tip to one or two short sentences, plain English,
 * no jargon (many players use a controller, and some cannot read a long
 * paragraph comfortably). docs/DECISIONS.md D481 lists the same tips.
 *
 * THE SETUP VIDEO: put the address in `video.src`.
 *   - a file shipped with the app: copy it into this folder
 *     (dashboard/public/onboarding/) and write its name, for example
 *       src: 'onboarding/zerostick-setup.mp4'
 *   - or a web address of an .mp4 / .webm file:
 *       src: 'https://zerostickgaming.com/videos/setup.mp4'
