 *   `captions` (optional) is a .vtt subtitles file, shown on by default.
 *
 * THE TIPS: one list. Each tip:
 *   id       never change it once shipped: it is how a phone remembers the
 *            tip was seen (change it and everyone sees that tip again)
 *   screen   which screen it belongs to (home, new-config, ai-scripts,
 *            script-editor, auto-green, mappings, aim, game-settings, device)
 *   text     what it says (title is the short bold line above it)
 *   anchor   what it points at, first match wins. A [data-tip="..."] name
 *            first, so a redesign only has to keep that one attribute
 *   needsAnchor  true: only show when the thing it points at is on screen
 *            (otherwise it waits for a later visit); false/absent: with
 *            nothing to point at it shows in the middle of the screen
 * Tips of one screen show in this order, at most three, with "Next".
 *
 * ES5 (DESIGN.md: every file phone.html loads). Loaded only when a tip or
 * the video is about to be shown (onboarding/boot.js), never at app start.
 */
